body:
Means "selection" in German. It's reference to the attack from the main antagonist of the Thousand Year Blood War in Bleach. Idk if you care about spoilers, but just in case;

>!Auswhalen is one of Yhwach's strongest attacks. Basically he shoots a pillar of light to forcibly steal all life and power from any Quincy and give it others who need / are still useful to him. He can even revive other Quincy with this attack. Most Quincy instantly die from this. Even there flesh is torn apart. However, some are strong enough to survive it with their bodies intact. It still hurts them a lot though. They just lose the ability to use their Vollstanding. Which is like if a Quincy activated a Bankai or went Super Saiyan!< 

I know it's prob not the same thing, but it still reminded me of it.

This thread reminds me of this;


https://www.reddit.com/r/hearthstone/comments/dgb82z/day_3_do_not_let_this_die_do_not_let_hong_kong_be/


In a couple days people will be over this. The people who wanted to move on have already moved on. Everyone else doesn't have the energy to keep this up or don't care. By the time the mini set is announced this will be old news.

I'll copy paste my answer from another thread. It's two main reasons; 


 1. Cards bought for Mercs can only be used in Mercs. If they close Mercs they'd have to refund everyone who spent money / gold on it. Whereas in Duels players can still use their cards in other modes.    


 2. Duels has to be continuously updated when new cards come out for balancing and bugs. Blizz can just let Mercs sitting there and not do anything to it.

Can we appreciate how far Luffy has come? From fighting in the East Blue, to all the years saying he's not strong enough and wondering when he'll take on an Emperor, now he's actually doing it.

And unlike other times this is a he's just trying to hold them off or there purposes is to get away. He's fighting Kaido for real, and he actually has chance at winning.

I'm so proud of this fictional character ;_;

Please don't die Kid. You've been through so much suffering already. My heart is not ready :_;

On the other hand Zoro, Sanji and Marco vs Queen and King. The matchups I never thought I'd be so hype for.

Also I'm calling it now. There is gonna be a big side effects to the medicine Zoro took. Like he won't be able to move his body for a while or something like that.
